SUMMARY:Galaxies Autumn 2026
DESCRIPTION:Galaxies Autumn 2026 will air on October 15 at 12:00 p.m. PT / 3:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe broadcast will feature multiple world premieres\, major announcements\, and exclusive trailers for over 50 games. \nConfirmed games and publishers include: \n1312 Interactive3DClouds4DivinityAntifreeze GamesArc GamesAstronautCat StudiosCRITICAL REFLEXCrytivoCurveball GamesDear VillagersDigital LighthouseEmbark Studios – Reveal of the first gameplay trailer for the next chapter of THE FINALSEntalto PublishingFictionsFocus Entertainment – Two reveals including an upcoming action platformerFriday SundaeFrontier DevelopmentsGambit DigitalGood Gate MediaHeadupHeat Death StudioHollow Beak GamesKallisti GamesKinetic PublishingKonami Digital Entertainment – An update on the classic franchise of CastlevaniaKRAFTONLINE GamesNekki – Exclusive SPINE trailerPARCO GAMESPesiiDomProbablyMonstersRaw Furyroom6Saber InteractiveSanta Barbara GamesSecret ModeShueisha GamesSquare Enix / Square Enix Collective – New trailer for a thrilling top-down extraction RPG and alpha test launchSuper Rare OriginalsTeam17Tiny DragonVertigo GamesWired ProductionsWombat BrawlerZA/UM
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/galaxies-autumn-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Event_Galaxies-Inits_10-15-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
