SUMMARY:The MIX Fall Game Showcase 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Media Indie Exchange will host The MIX Fall Game Showcase 2026 on October 16 at 9:00 a.m. PT / 12:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe broadcast will feature new game announcements\, reveals\, trailers\, gameplay\, and more. In total\, it will feature more than 65 independent titles across PC and consoles and guest hosts including Tim Schafer\, Greg Miller\, David Lucio and Akeem Lawanson.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/the-mix-fall-game-showcase-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_The-MIX-Fall-Game-Showcase-2026_10-16-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
