SUMMARY:ID@Xbox Showcase: October 20\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft will host an ID@Xbox Showcase in partnership with IGN on October 20 at 10:00 a.m. PT / 1:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube\, Twitch\, Facebook\, Twitter\, TikTok\, and IGN.com. \nThe broadcast will feature new trailers\, gameplay\, and more from over 20 games\, including The Wolf Among Us Remastered\, CRITICAL REFLEX\, and “tons of world premieres.”
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/idxbox-showcase-october-20-2026
